  <running_head>Castigatio Paral.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">terpretationem. Quod primum con-</l>
    <l n="2">cernit, omnia exemplaria græca, quæ</l>
    <l n="3">ego vidi, etiam à Pontificibus approbata, habent <i>ἀργυρέους</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4">
      <i>δραχμὰς διςχιλίας argenti drachmas bis mille.</i> E contra Vul-</l>
    <l n="5">gata habet <i>duodecim</i> millia. Quam</l>
    <l n="6">multiplicationem suo commodo Jesuitæ</l>
    <l n="7">studiosè retinent. Item; <i>ἐξεγοντο</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>γὴν ἀμαρτίας θυσίαν offerri pro pec-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>catis sacrificium.</i> Vulgatus autem offerri</l>
    <l n="10">pro peccatis <i>mortuorum</i> sacrificium.</l>
    <l n="11">Error compilatoris Maccabaicorum</l>
    <l n="12">librorum notatur duplex. Unus quòd</l>
    <l n="13">contra universam veteris Testamenti</l>
    <l n="14">scripturam orationes &amp; oblationes pro</l>
    <l n="15">mortuis statuit. Alter, quòd scribit</l>
    <l n="16">(contra mentem Judæ Machabæi)</l>
    <l n="17">pecunias istas Hierosolymam missas ad</l>
    <l n="18">instituendum sacrificium pro redimen-</l>
    <l n="19">do peccato demortuorum tantùm: Cùm</l>
    <l n="20">id factum sit ad faciendum sacri-</l>
    <l n="21">ficium pro toto exercitu, cuius magna</l>
    <l n="22">pars ob peccatum contra legem</l>
    <l n="23">Dei commissum, cecidit. Falsa denique</l>
  </main_text>
